      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "物质的密度也可以用克/厘米$^3$做单位来表示（图 49）. 作",
        "为一个例子，让我们把铁的密度用这种单位来表示. 铁的密",
        "度是 $7800$ 千克/米$^3$，这就是说 $1$ 米$^3$铁的质量等于 $7800$ 千克."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把质量用克来表示，而体积用立方厘米来表示："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$7800\\text{ 千克}=7800000\\text{ 克}$；$1\\text{ 米}^3=1000000\\text{ 厘米}^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将质量（用克表示）除以体积（用厘米$^3$表示），即求得铁的",
        "密度为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\rho=\\frac{7800000\\text{ 克}}{1000000\\text{ 厘米}^3}=7.8\\text{ 克/厘米}^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 49",
      "box": [
        216,
        858,
        1082,
        256
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-49"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 49",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同种物质处于不同的状态：固态、液态及气态时，其密度",
        "是不同的. 例如，冰的密度是 $900$ 千克/米$^3$，水的密度是 $1000$",
        "千克/米$^3$，而水蒸汽的密度是 $0.598$ 千克/米$^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
